.html", "OnSlips.dc.html", "OnMaking.dc.html", "OnHome.dc.html", "OnSheet.dc.html", "OnCamera.dc.html", "OnCheckin.dc.html", "OnKeep.dc.html", "OnDevice.dc.html", "OnLaptop.dc.html", "Welcome.dc.html", "OnOffline.dc.html", "Laptop.dc.html", "DocPitch1.dc.html", "DocPitch2.dc.html", "DocPitch3.dc.html", "DocDemoDay.dc.html", "DocOnboarding1.dc.html", "DocOnboarding2.dc.html", "DocPersona.dc.html", "DocHomeJobs.dc.html", "DocSetup.dc.html", "SpecPRD1.dc.html", "SpecPRD2.dc.html", "SpecPRD3.dc.html", "SpecPRD4.dc.html", "SpecStories1.dc.html", "SpecStories2.dc.html", "SpecBackend1.dc.html", "SpecBackend2.dc.html", "SpecBackend3.dc.html", "SpecBackend4.dc.html", "SpecBackend5.dc.html", "SpecBackend6.dc.html", "SpecBackend7.dc.html", "SpecClair1.dc.html", "SpecClair2.dc.html", "SpecClair3.dc.html", "SpecClair4.dc.html", "SpecClair5.dc.html", "SpecUI1.dc.html", "SpecUI2.dc.html", "SpecADRs1.dc.html", "SpecADRs2.dc.html", "SpecGlossary.dc.html", "XsKey.dc.html", "XsHomeLight.dc.html", "XsHomeDark.dc.html"], "notes": {"row0": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Quilter's Workbench: Quilt's design system", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2640}, "screens": {"x": -620, "y": 1340, "w": 480, "size": "m", "fill": "orange", "text": "Every screen is in Quilter's Workbench (Nov 19).\n\nRow 1 · Home and finding: Home, Your apps, Search, You, Reminder.\nRow 2 · Clair: tap the Clair button, hold it to talk, tell and ask, data vs general questions, a photo with a question, share a file in, a fridge photo that asks what's low, what Clair remembers.\nRow 3 · Demo path: Groceries, Review receipt, Budget, Calendar, Edit an item.\nRow 4 · Clair builds an app: describe, pick a layout, arrange, connect and add, ready; Clair chat.\nRow 5 · Apps made from blocks: Workout (5 tabs), Log a set, To-dos.\nRow 6 · Laptop.\nRow 7 · First open: onboarding, Welcome to second device.\n\nThe main button is Clair: one place to put anything in or ask anything, and it can land in several apps. A receipt is one example. Search is pull-down.\n\nWords: Clair builds “apps”; sections inside an app are “tabs”. Buttons say what happens."}, "flows": {"x": -620, "y": 3940, "w": 480, "size": "m", "fill": "teal", "text": "Click paths (press Play on any board)\n\nDemo: Home > Clair > Photo > Review receipt > Add to 3 apps > See Budget ($412 → $376) > Calendar.\n\nClair: Home > Clair > “Spent $12 on lunch” > Add to 3 apps; the same sheet answers “Can I afford $60 concert tickets?” from Budget. Hold Clair to talk. File > a shared syllabus > Add to 2 apps.\n\nPhoto and ask: a photo with a question gets an answer, not a log (Clair offers “Log these items or just answer?”); receipts still go to Review receipt. Data answers cite your apps; general answers say so and offer a tracker.\n\nComing back: Home > Show 3 more > Clair's evening check-in > Review > Update 3 apps.\n\nBuild: Your apps > New app > Build it > pick a layout > Arrange or Use this layout > Add to my apps > ready.\n\nEverywhere: the pinned bar (Budget, Groceries, Calendar, To-dos) and the Clair button."}, "links": {"x": -620, "y": 6540, "w": 480, "size": "m", "fill": "yellow", "text": "Live versions and docs (Nov 19)\n\nMotion catalogue: every animation, named and playable, with a reduced-motion switch: claude.ai/artifact/VPM8mrtefTzb7n6e5GwLAC\n\nHome prototype (demo start state, Clair sheet, thread pull): claude.ai/artifact/Wr2p4rLD6Zgow3uxmSykRV\n\nFlows prototype (build an app, swipe rows, sheets, pull to search, Just used on the bar): claude.ai/artifact/HrLSUSPiXKCLphYfHVFxne\n\nDocs in the repo: docs/prd.md, docs/ui-tech-plan.md, docs/demo-readiness.md"}, "onboarding": {"x": -620, "y": 9240, "w": 480, "size": "m", "fill": "teal", "text": "First open (docs/onboarding.md). Press Play on Welcome and tap through.\n\nWelcome > Start > What slips? (pick Money, Groceries, To-dos) > Make my apps > starter apps appear, pins fill (Calendar last) > Open Home > Clair button > Photo > camera pre-prompt > Continue > Review receipt (row 3: the first basted card) > Add to 3 apps (the first stitched moment).\n\nEvening: check-in > Review > Remind me. Then Keep your quilt > Continue with Google > Add a device (code 482 913) > the laptop: type 482913 to join, anything else shows the error.\n\nBranches: Skip on What slips? goes to the skipped-picks Home (the old Day one board, updated: no name, first prompt). Not now on the camera ask shows the camera-off line. No connection on first open: Try again."}, "row1": {"x": 0, "y": 1040, "text": "Home and finding your apps", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2270}, "row2": {"x": 0, "y": 2340, "text": "Clair: tell, talk, ask, share", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3680}, "row3": {"x": 0, "y": 3640, "text": "Demo path: one receipt updates three apps", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2270}, "row4": {"x": 0, "y": 4940, "text": "Clair builds an app", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2740}, "row5": {"x": 0, "y": 6240, "text": "Apps made from blocks", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1800}, "row6": {"x": 0, "y": 8940, "text": "First open: onboarding", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 6450}, "row7": {"x": 0, "y": 7540, "text": "Laptop: the same apps, wider", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1800}, "title_docs": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Docs for people: pitch, demo day, onboarding, research, setup", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 8080, "page": "docs"}, "title_specs": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Specs for building: PRD, stories, backend, Clair, UI, decisions, glossary", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 9440, "page": "specs"}, "row_links": {"x": 0, "y": 10384, "text": "Everything else made for Quilt", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2080}, "link_1": {"kind": "link", "x": 0, "y": 10684, "href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/Wr2p4rLD6Zgow3uxmSykRV", "title": "Home prototype: demo start, Clair sheet, thread pull", "linkKind": "design"}, "link_2": {"kind": "link", "x": 720, "y": 10684, "href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/HrLSUSPiXKCLphYfHVFxne", "title": "Flows prototype: build an app, rows, sheets, laptop", "linkKind": "design"}, "link_3": {